# Design system (mandatory)

Read `design-system/DESIGN-SYSTEM.md` before UI work. There is one system for every route (no brand/tools split).

- Tokens only (`design-system/tokens.css`); logical CSS properties for RTL.
- Reuse `components/ui/*` and the classes in `src/styles/components.css`.
- Motion confirms user actions; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Verify at 360 / 768 / 1280px, light + dark.

Stack: React 19 + Vite + Tailwind v4 · Readex Pro + IBM Plex Sans Arabic.
